This project uses React Compiler for automatic optimization.

DO NOT use the following:
- useMemo
- useCallback
- React.memo

React Compiler handles all memoization automatically.
Write clean, simple code without manual performance optimizations.

Tech Stack:
- React + TypeScript
- React Compiler
- Bun (package manager & runtime)
- Biome (linter/formatter)
- Tolgee (i18n)

Development Commands - ALWAYS use Bun:
- Install: bun install (NOT npm/yarn/pnpm)
- Dev: bun run dev
- Build: bun run build
- Test: bun test or bun run test
- Scripts: bun run <script-name>

DO NOT use npm, yarn, or pnpm commands.
